{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017134245507-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017141453\"/><p>現場為崇信街一單位。</p><p>油塘發生盜竊案。今日(17日)早上8時38分，執法人員接獲一名姓陳(34歲)女子報案，指懷疑姓林(40歲)丈夫盜去崇信街6號一單位內，的1隻值約15萬元的手錶及3個共值約30萬元的手袋。人員接報到場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌盜竊將林男拘捕，他現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T06:18:58.406095+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T05:42:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T06:17:37.005623+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T06:17:37.005623+00:00","content_hash":"0b956ea9aca71b53e8383c1564bfbc2e7f70467e06ab35c4e6953a1a1093465c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}